  <div class="section-title">JOB SUMMARY</div>
  <p>The Assistant Athletic Director of Compliance and Eligibility is responsible for the development, implementation, and monitoring of all systems designed to ensure compliance with the NCAA, Great American Conference, and University regulations. They are responsible to coordinate all reporting requirements with the NCAA, Great American Conference (GAC) and University as it relates to compliance and student-athlete eligibility.</p>

